no other language yet.

legitimacy-06-58
00:03:42.740 --> 00:03:45.580
The passport's edges are still blurred.

legitimacy-06-59
00:03:45.580 --> 00:03:50.830
Beside it, a small hand-drawn flag has
appeared.

legitimacy-06-60
00:03:51.930 --> 00:03:53.490
Next episode:

legitimacy-06-61
00:03:53.490 --> 00:04:00.339
Symbolic parasitism: when two checklists
overlap, why do their boxes line up

legitimacy-06-62
